  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FUNDO CASA GRANT PAYMENT 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project, co-funded by Ireland and Norway, aims to support Indigenous peoples to expand their role in the autonomous governance, protection and sustainable management of their territories through access to means to strengthen their organisations and defend their rights. Specifically, over 3 years it will provide direct financial support to 50 Indigenous organisations to support medium sized project aimed at 1) territorial and environmental management of territories, 2) protection and security of Indigenous territories, or 3) recognition and defence of territorial rights. Projects that support the socioeconomic and political participation of Indigenous women will be prioritised.</narrative>
  </description>
